{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00477",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.21,
      "end_seconds": 4.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Okay, good afternoon. Have a seat and we'll begin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.3,
      "end_seconds": 8.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Hello. Is it okay if I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 9.57,
      "end_seconds": 14.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.48,
      "end_seconds": 17.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Did you find the place alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.96,
      "end_seconds": 24.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "Yes, it was easy enough. The parking was the hard part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.46,
      "end_seconds": 26.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Okay. Start wherever you like."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 26.76,
      "end_seconds": 30.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "She's been having been forgetting things lately, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.9,
      "end_seconds": 33.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.21,
      "end_seconds": 45.49,
      "duration_seconds": 11.28,
      "text": "Hmm, it's been going on for about a month. I've been repeating the same questions too. And difficulty finding words, too. I've also been misplacing things, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.57,
      "end_seconds": 48.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Have you had any headache?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.68,
      "end_seconds": 50.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Not at all, no headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 54.16,
      "end_seconds": 57.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice headache. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.31,
      "end_seconds": 62.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.41,
      "end_seconds": 73.0,
      "duration_seconds": 8.59,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Any hallucinations, weakness on one side, low mood or trouble with bladder control at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.84,
      "end_seconds": 75.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.76,
      "end_seconds": 79.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.37,
      "end_seconds": 81.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.87,
      "end_seconds": 85.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Right, what medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.26,
      "end_seconds": 90.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "I take losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 92.23,
      "end_seconds": 99.91,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "Right, doctor, I think the last prescription for the losartan was 100 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.4,
      "end_seconds": 104.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.47,
      "end_seconds": 108.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.75,
      "end_seconds": 111.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.19,
      "end_seconds": 115.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "I had a hysterectomy about twelve years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.82,
      "end_seconds": 132.59,
      "duration_seconds": 15.77,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.24,
      "end_seconds": 135.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.32,
      "end_seconds": 140.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.76,
      "end_seconds": 143.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.8,
      "end_seconds": 159.39,
      "duration_seconds": 14.59,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.24,
      "end_seconds": 161.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.13,
      "end_seconds": 165.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.59,
      "end_seconds": 171.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "I've had diabetes, yes. High blood pressure, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.27,
      "end_seconds": 186.61,
      "duration_seconds": 12.34,
      "text": "Okay. Yes, I can see the diabetes in your file as well. Right, so that's your known high blood pressure. We'll keep that in mind today. Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.31,
      "end_seconds": 198.78,
      "duration_seconds": 11.47,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.52,
      "end_seconds": 202.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.45,
      "end_seconds": 213.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.41,
      "end_seconds": 238.99,
      "duration_seconds": 12.58,
      "text": "Okay: height 161 centimetres, pulse 72, weight 85 kilos, blood pressure 126 over 71, BMI works out to 32.8, temperature 36.8, SpO2 97 percent on room air, respiratory rate 14."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.5,
      "end_seconds": 241.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.61,
      "end_seconds": 260.47,
      "duration_seconds": 18.86,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.88,
      "end_seconds": 262.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "So, okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.5,
      "end_seconds": 268.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.49,
      "end_seconds": 271.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Okay, bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.94,
      "end_seconds": 286.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Your gait is steady and the tone in your limbs is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.06,
      "end_seconds": 318.42,
      "duration_seconds": 27.36,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.75,
      "end_seconds": 322.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.66,
      "end_seconds": 339.07,
      "duration_seconds": 15.41,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, my working impression is memory difficulties that need to be worked up. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I can't rule out early dementia yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.53,
      "end_seconds": 344.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.17,
      "end_seconds": 364.5,
      "duration_seconds": 17.33,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with memory difficulties that need to be worked up do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been forgetting things lately for about a month, and no weakness on one side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.61,
      "end_seconds": 367.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.0,
      "end_seconds": 370.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.34,
      "end_seconds": 372.2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 387.2,
      "end_seconds": 397.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. We should do a thyroid test for memory loss. I'm going to order a CT scan of the head, for memory loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 398.44,
      "end_seconds": 399.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 400.75,
      "end_seconds": 423.8,
      "duration_seconds": 23.05,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange blood tests for memory loss. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Keep a daily routine and write things down, a notebook by the door works well. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 424.99,
      "end_seconds": 434.63,
      "duration_seconds": 9.64,
      "text": "We'll refer you to the memory clinic. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 435.32,
      "end_seconds": 436.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 437.64,
      "end_seconds": 443.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 446.95,
      "end_seconds": 448.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 449.98,
      "end_seconds": 453.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 454.4,
      "end_seconds": 458.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 459.58,
      "end_seconds": 466.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.95,
      "text": "Right, before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 467.07,
      "end_seconds": 471.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 475.5,
      "end_seconds": 479.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, we're done for today. Take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 479.94,
      "end_seconds": 483.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "No, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}